{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49510","headline":"临江仙 一 · 鹿虔扆","name":"临江仙 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金锁重门荒苑静，绮窗愁对秋空。\n翠华一去寂无踪。\n玉楼歌吹，声断已随风。\n烟月不知人事改，夜阑还照深宫。\n藕花相向野塘中。\n暗伤亡国，清露泣香红。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鹿虔扆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}